ase_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "997411404840848"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1792716575, "id": "28649800308056330", "version": "5001", "version_code": 5001, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6320120764784270", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28676918428677851"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "997411404840848"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1792631844, "id": "28635940856108942", "version": "5000", "version_code": 5000, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6320120764784270", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28676918428677851"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "997411404840848"}]}, "change_log": "WorldLens v49:\n\n# 3D Street View \ud83c\udf0d\n\n- Hundreds of billions of panoramic images around the world, now in photorealistic 3D - https://youtu.be/oZQO9kneP_w\n\n- WorldLens\u2019 3D Street View goes beyond stereoscopic rendering, generating full 3D environments with realistic and consistent 6DoF reconstruction.\n\n- The mode is available as a new \u2018Street View Quality\u2019 option in \u2018Preferences\u2019, loading at up to full 8k resolution with no compression or speed compromises.\n\n- Disclaimer: As with any AI technology, imperfections in generated results may occur under certain conditions. Although the model is trained on diverse 360\u00b0 data, it cannot always produce fully precise 3D environments.\n\n# Street View Updates \ud83d\udd27\n\n- Faster Street View loading times. After evaluating user feedback and comparing advanced streaming systems, WorldLens\u2019 \u2018Auto\u2019 and \u20183D\u2019 Street View modes now load content much more quickly and efficiently, improving immersion, performance and speed.\n\n- On the selection circle, a subtle directional pointer will fade in when nearby navigation spots are too distant. This improves navigation awareness with zero impact on immersion.\n\n- Street View navigation now supports covering larger distances at once with accurate distant aiming.\n\n# World AI Updates \ud83e\udd16\n\n- World AI with Web Search: Effortlessly get the latest information on local news, events, or even user reviews for a random restaurant!\n\n- Token previews: Delivering a quicker communication experience, you can now see responses as they\u2019re being generated.\n\n- Longer context window: World AI will now retain and stay aware of more conversation parts.\n\n- Smarter, powerful, faster, with enhanced speech and multilingual understanding: World AI now uses the latest transcription and text-to-speech models, delivering improved multilingual processing along with faster and more natural speech generation.\n\n- Addressed speech generation issues such as number misspellings.\n\n# Bookmarks: Stored Viewing Direction \ud83d\udd16\n\n- When saving a location, your centered viewing direction will now be stored. The original viewing angle will be preserved each time when you load a saved location.\n\n# Additional \ud83d\udd27\n\n- Newly discovered and reported bugs have been fixed.\n\n- Improved memory usage stability.\n\n- Improved \u2018Immersive Mode\u2019 nighttime lighting to create a more lifelike ambiance.\n\n- Integrated a very subtle glass texture effect for the glassy menu background.\n\n- Optimized collision detection with improved movement freedom and lower OOB risk.\n\n- When tapping or typing, the UI and keyboard now prevent accidental movement when using Hand Tracking.\n\n- Addressed an \u2018Upscale 3D Imagery\u2019 timing issue and improved the feature\u2019s performance.\n\n- Cloud rendering system designed for more realistic visuals, with dynamic movement supporting any direction.\n\n- Fixed keyboard spacing and symmetry issues.\n\n- Special new soundtrack - https://youtu.be/udiwduCxkcI \ud83c\udf0d\ud83c\udfb6\n\n- A dozen more quality-of-life improvements made thanks to your feedback!\n\n\u2014\n\ud83d\udc46 scroll up \ud83d\udc46\n\u2014\n\nEverything has been, and is being thoroughly tested, but if you encounter anything that you may think isn\u2019t 100% intentional, please report at contact.worldlens.site !", "created_date": 1781037733, "id": "26949660691403642", "version": "4918", "version_code": 4918, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6320120764784270", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28676918428677851"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "997411404840848"}]}, "change_log": "WorldLens v49:\n\n# 3D Street View \ud83c\udf0d\n\n- Hundreds of billions of panoramic images around the world, now in photorealistic 3D - https://youtu.be/oZQO9kneP_w\n\n- WorldLens\u2019 3D Street View goes beyond stereoscopic rendering, generating full 3D environments with realistic and consistent 6DoF reconstruction.\n\n- The mode is available as a new \u2018Street View Quality\u2019 option in \u2018Preferences\u2019, loading at up to full 8k resolution with no compression or speed compromises.\n\n- Disclaimer: As with any AI technology, imperfections in generated results may occur under certain conditions. Although the model is trained on diverse 360\u00b0 data, it cannot always produce fully precise 3D environments.\n\n# Street View Updates \ud83d\udd27\n\n- Faster Street View loading times. After evaluating user feedback and comparing advanced streaming systems, WorldLens\u2019 \u2018Auto\u2019 and \u20183D\u2019 Street View modes now load content much more quickly and efficiently, improving immersion, performance and speed.\n\n- On the selection circle, a subtle directional pointer will fade in when nearby navigation spots are too distant. This improves navigation awareness with zero impact on immersion.\n\n- Street View navigation now supports covering larger distances at once with accurate distant aiming.\n\n# World AI Updates \ud83e\udd16\n\n- World AI with Web Search: Effortlessly get the latest information on local news, events, or even user reviews for a random restaurant!\n\n- Token previews: Delivering a quicker communication experience, you can now see responses as they\u2019re being generated.\n\n- Longer context window: World AI will now retain and stay aware of more conversation parts.\n\n- Smarter, powerful, faster, with enhanced speech and multilingual understanding: World AI now uses the latest transcription and text-to-speech models, delivering improved multilingual processing along with faster and more natural speech generation.\n\n- Addressed speech generation issues such as number misspellings.\n\n# Bookmarks: Stored Viewing Direction \ud83d\udd16\n\n- When saving a location, your centered viewing direction will now be stored. The original viewing angle will be preserved each time when you load a saved location.\n\n# Additional \ud83d\udd27\n\n- Newly discovered and reported bugs have been fixed.\n\n- Improved memory usage stability.\n\n- Improved \u2018Immersive Mode\u2019 nighttime lighting to create a more lifelike ambiance.\n\n- Integrated a very subtle glass texture effect for the glassy menu background.\n\n- Optimized collision detection with improved movement freedom and lower OOB risk.\n\n- When tapping or typing, the UI and keyboard now prevent accidental movement when using Hand Tracking.\n\n- Addressed an \u2018Upscale 3D Imagery\u2019 timing issue and improved the feature\u2019s performance.\n\n- Cloud rendering system designed for more realistic visuals, with dynamic movement supporting any direction.\n\n- Fixed keyboard spacing and symmetry issues.\n\n- Special new soundtrack - https://youtu.be/udiwduCxkcI \ud83c\udf0d\ud83c\udfb6\n\n- A dozen more quality-of-life improvements made thanks to your feedback!\n\n\u2014\n\ud83d\udc46 scroll up \ud83d\udc46\n\u2014\n\nEverything has been, and is being thoroughly tested, but if you encounter anything that you may think isn\u2019t 100% intentional, please report at contact.worldlens.site !", "created_date": 1780960674, "id": "26938020322567679", "version": "4917", "version_code": 4917, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}